NoConnect is a modified version of Briar (https://briarproject.org), which is
Copyright (C) The Briar Project and licensed under the GNU General Public
License version 3. The NoConnect modules map to Briar's as follows:

  nc-api, nc-core, nc-android, nc-j2se              <- Briar "bramble" modules
  noconnect-api, noconnect-core, noconnect-android  <- Briar "briar" modules

Modifications include renaming of packages, classes, resources and protocol
identifiers, removal of the build expiry lock, and other changes recorded in
the git history of this repository.

